<svg viewBox="0 0 1248 780" role="img" aria-label="Architecture. A browser request through the Vercel frontend, and a daily GitHub Actions cron, both call the FastAPI service on Fly.io, which calls run_agent. Inside the agent core, input guardrails feed a tool-calling loop whose findings pass an output guardrail, lint_finding, which sends violations back as a retry. The loop calls check_control, retrieve_policy and draft_fix. check_control reads, and only reads, the customer's GitHub org and AWS account through a GitHub App and an assumed AWS role. retrieve_policy uses Chroma Cloud and a single local Ollama instance for embeddings, with no fallback. draft_fix calls Claude Haiku 4.5 through OpenRouter. Findings, approvals and usage go to Postgres; spans go to Langfuse.">
